  "meslek.reports.emptyDesc": ["Malzeme stoku al, satışa hazırlan — ilk gün sonu raporu 21:00'da burada görünür.", "Buy supplies, prepare for sales — first end-of-day report appears here at 21:00.", "Buy supplies, prepare for sales — first end-of-day report appears here at 21:00.", "Kaufe Material, bereite Verkauf vor — erster Tagesbericht um 21:00 hier.", "Achète du stock, prépare les ventes — premier rapport à 21:00 ici.", "Compra stock, prepárate — primer informe a las 21:00 aquí.", "Compra scorte, preparati — primo report alle 21:00 qui.", "Compra stock, prepara vendas — primeiro relatório às 21:00 aqui.", "Compre estoque, prepare vendas — primeiro relatório às 21:00 aqui.", "Koop voorraad, bereid verkoop voor — eerste rapport om 21:00 hier.", "Cumpără stoc, pregătește vânzări — primul raport la 21:00 aici.", "Nakupuj zásoby, připrav prodej — první report v 21:00 zde.", "Αγόρασε απόθεμα, ετοιμάσου — πρώτη αναφορά 21:00 εδώ.", "Закупи материалы — первый отчёт в 21:00 здесь.", "采购库存、准备销售 — 首个日终报告 21:00 在此显示。", "اشترِ مخزونًا — أول تقرير 21:00 هنا."],
