  "meslek.hero.npcTitle": ["🏛️ NPC İşleri", "🏛️ NPC Jobs", "🏛️ NPC Jobs", "🏛️ NPC-Jobs", "🏛️ Emplois PNJ", "🏛️ Trabajos NPC", "🏛️ Lavori NPC", "🏛️ Empregos NPC", "🏛️ Empregos NPC", "🏛️ NPC-banen", "🏛️ Joburi NPC", "🏛️ NPC práce", "🏛️ Δουλειές NPC", "🏛️ Работа у NPC", "🏛️ NPC 工作", "🏛️ وظائف NPC"],
  "meslek.hero.npcDesc": ["Belediye, cafe, hastane ve daha fazlasında NPC'lerle mülakat ver. Yeteneklerin uygunsa işe alın; her gün maaş ve yetenek puanı kazan.", "Interview with NPCs at city hall, cafes, hospitals and more. Get hired if your skills fit; earn daily salary and skill points.", "Interview with NPCs at city hall, cafes, hospitals and more. Get hired if your skills fit; earn daily salary and skill points.", "Vorstellungsgespräche mit NPCs in Rathaus, Cafés, Krankenhäusern u.a. Bei passenden Skills eingestellt werden; täglich Gehalt und Skill-Punkte.", "Passe des entretiens PNJ à la mairie, cafés, hôpitaux, etc. Embauché si compétences OK; salaire et points quotidiens.", "Entrevistas con NPCs en ayuntamiento, cafés, hospitales, etc. Contratado si encajan tus habilidades; salario y puntos diarios.", "Colloqui con NPC in municipio, bar, ospedali, ecc. Assunto se le skill vanno bene; stipendio e punti giornalieri.", "Entrevistas com NPCs na câmara, cafés, hospitais, etc. Contratado se as skills couberem; salário e pontos diários.", "Entrevistas com NPCs na prefeitura, cafés, hospitais, etc. Contratado se suas skills servirem; salário e pontos diários.", "Solliciteer bij NPCs in gemeentehuis, cafés, ziekenhuizen, etc. Aangenomen bij passende skills; dagloon en punten.", "Interviuri NPC la primărie, cafenele, spitale, etc. Angajat dacă skill-urile se potrivesc; salariu și puncte zilnice.", "Pohovory s NPC na radnici, v kavárnách, nemocnicích atd. Přijet při vhodných skillech; denní plat a body.", "Συνεντεύξεις με NPC σε δημαρχείο, καφέ, νοσοκομεία κ.λπ. Πρόσληψη αν ταιριάζουν skills· μισθός και πόντοι.", "Собеседования с NPC в мэрии, кафе, больницах и т.д. При подходящих навыках — работа, зарплата и очки.", "在市政厅、咖啡馆、医院等地与 NPC 面试。技能合适即可录用；每日获得工资和技能点。", "مقابلات مع NPC في البلدية والمقاهي والمستشفيات. إذا تناسبت مهاراتك تُوظَّف؛ راتب ونقاط يومية."],
  "meslek.hero.companiesTitle": ["🏢 Oyuncu Şirketleri", "🏢 Player Companies", "🏢 Player Companies", "🏢 Spielerfirmen", "🏢 Entreprises Joueurs", "🏢 Empresas de Jugadores", "🏢 Aziende Giocatori", "🏢 Empresas de Jogadores", "🏢 Empresas de Jogadores", "🏢 Spelersbedrijven", "🏢 Companii Jucători", "🏢 Hráčské Firmy", "🏢 Εταιρείες Παικτών", "🏢 Компании игроков", "🏢 玩家公司", "🏢 شركات اللاعبين"],
  "meslek.hero.companiesDesc": ["Diğer oyuncuların kurduğu şirketlere başvur. Patron seni kabul ederse günlük maaş alırsın. Aynı anda yalnızca bir işte olabilirsin.", "Apply to companies founded by other players. If the boss accepts you, you get a daily salary. You can only hold one job at a time.", "Apply to companies founded by other players. If the boss accepts you, you get a daily salary. You can only hold one job at a time.", "Bewirb dich bei Spielerfirmen. Bei Annahme tägliches Gehalt. Nur ein Job gleichzeitig.", "Postule aux entreprises joueurs. Si accepté, salaire quotidien. Un seul emploi à la fois.", "Postula a empresas de jugadores. Si te aceptan, salario diario. Solo un trabajo a la vez.", "Candidati ad aziende giocatore. Se accettato, stipendio giornaliero. Un solo lavoro alla volta.", "Candidata-te a empresas de jogadores. Se aceite, salário diário. Só um emprego de cada vez.", "Candidate-se a empresas de jogadores. Se aceito, salário diário. Apenas um emprego por vez.", "Solliciteer bij spelersbedrijven. Bij acceptatie dagloon. Slechts één baan tegelijk.", "Aplică la firme jucători. Dacă ești acceptat, salariu zilnic. Un singur job.", "Přihlas se k hráčským firmám. Po přijetí denní plat. Jen jedna práce najednou.", "Κάνε αίτηση σε εταιρείες παικτών. Αν σε δεχτούν, ημερήσιος μισθός. Μόνο μία δουλειά.", "Подавай заявки в компании игроков. При приёме — зарплата. Только одна работа.", "申请其他玩家创建的公司。老板录用后获得日薪。同时只能有一份工作。", "قدّم على شركات اللاعبين. إذا قبلك الزعيم، راتب يومي. وظيفة واحدة فقط."],
  "meslek.hero.createTitle": ["👔 Şirket Kur", "👔 Start a Company", "👔 Start a Company", "👔 Firma Gründen", "👔 Créer une Entreprise", "👔 Crear Empresa", "👔 Crea Azienda", "👔 Criar Empresa", "👔 Criar Empresa", "👔 Bedrijf Oprichten", "👔 Creează Firmă", "👔 Založ Firmu", "👔 Ίδρυσε Εταιρεία", "👔 Создать Компанию", "👔 创建公司", "👔 أسس شركة"],
  "meslek.hero.createDesc": ["Malzeme stoku al, <b>en az bir oyuncu çalışan</b> işe al, bina yükselt, reklam ver. Çalışan ve stok olmadan satış yapılamaz; günlük raporlar kasa hareketlerini gösterir.", "Buy supplies, <b>hire at least one player employee</b>, upgrade buildings, run ads. No sales without staff and stock; daily reports show vault activity.", "Buy supplies, <b>hire at least one player employee</b>, upgrade buildings, run ads. No sales without staff and stock; daily reports show vault activity.", "Kaufe Material, <b>stelle mindestens 1 Spieler ein</b>, upgrade Gebäude, Werbung. Ohne Personal und Lager kein Verkauf; Tagesberichte zeigen Kassenbewegungen.", "Achète du stock, <b>embauche au moins 1 joueur</b>, améliore bâtiments, pub. Pas de ventes sans staff et stock; rapports quotidiens.", "Compra stock, <b>contrata al menos 1 jugador</b>, mejora edificios, publicidad. Sin personal y stock no hay ventas; informes diarios.", "Compra scorte, <b>assumi almeno 1 giocatore</b>, potenzia edifici, pubblicità. Senza staff e stock niente vendite; report giornalieri.", "Compra stock, <b>contrata pelo menos 1 jogador</b>, melhora edifícios, publicidade. Sem staff e stock sem vendas; relatórios diários.", "Compre estoque, <b>contrate pelo menos 1 jogador</b>, melhore prédios, anúncios. Sem equipe e estoque sem vendas; relatórios diários.", "Koop voorraad, <b>huur minimaal 1 speler in</b>, upgrade gebouwen, reclame. Geen verkoop zonder personeel en stock; dagrapporten.", "Cumpără stoc, <b>angajează cel puțin 1 jucător</b>, upgrade clădiri, reclamă. Fără personal și stoc fără vânzări; rapoarte zilnice.", "Nakupuj zásoby, <b>najmi alespoň 1 hráče</b>, vylepši budovy, reklamu. Bez lidí a skladu žádný prodej; denní reporty.", "Αγόρασε απόθεμα, <b>πρόσλαβε τουλάχιστον 1 παίκτη</b>, αναβάθμισε κτίρια, διαφήμιση. Χωρίς προσωπικό και stock όχι πωλήσεις.", "Закупай материалы, <b>найми минимум 1 игрока</b>, улучшай здания, рекламу. Без сотрудников и склада нет продаж.", "采购库存、<b>至少雇佣一名玩家员工</b>、升级建筑、投放广告。没有员工和库存无法销售；每日报告显示金库变动。", "اشترِ مخزونًا، <b>وظّف لاعبًا واحدًا على الأقل</b>، طوّر المباني، أعلن. لا مبيعات بدون موظفين ومخزون."],
