  "meslek.manage.dailyReportBtn": ["📊 Günlük Rapor", "📊 Daily Report", "📊 Daily Report", "📊 Tagesbericht", "📊 Rapport Quotidien", "📊 Informe Diario", "📊 Report Giornaliero", "📊 Relatório Diário", "📊 Relatório Diário", "📊 Dagrapport", "📊 Raport Zilnic", "📊 Denní Report", "📊 Ημερήσια Αναφορά", "📊 Ежедневный Отчёт", "📊 每日报告", "📊 تقرير يومي"],
  "meslek.manage.noProduction": ["⚠️ <b>Çalışan olmadan üretim ve satış yapılamaz.</b> NPC müşteri talebi oluşur; satış için <b>stok + en az 1 oyuncu çalışan</b> gerekir. Patron tek başına üretim yapmaz.", "⚠️ <b>No production or sales without employees.</b> NPC customer demand is generated; sales need <b>stock + at least 1 player employee</b>. The boss cannot produce alone.", "⚠️ <b>No production or sales without employees.</b> NPC customer demand is generated; sales need <b>stock + at least 1 player employee</b>. The boss cannot produce alone.", "⚠️ <b>Ohne Mitarbeiter keine Produktion/Verkauf.</b> NPC-Nachfrage entsteht; Verkauf braucht <b>Lager + min. 1 Spieler</b>. Chef produziert nicht allein.", "⚠️ <b>Pas de production/vente sans employés.</b> Demande PNJ générée; ventes = <b>stock + min. 1 joueur</b>. Le patron ne produit pas seul.", "⚠️ <b>Sin empleados no hay producción/ventas.</b> Demanda NPC generada; ventas = <b>stock + mín. 1 jugador</b>. El jefe no produce solo.", "⚠️ <b>Senza dipendenti niente produzione/vendite.</b> Domanda NPC generata; vendite = <b>stock + min. 1 giocatore</b>. Il capo non produce da solo.", "⚠️ <b>Sem funcionários não há produção/vendas.</b> Procura NPC gerada; vendas = <b>stock + min. 1 jogador</b>. O patrão não produz sozinho.", "⚠️ <b>Sem funcionários não há produção/vendas.</b> Demanda NPC gerada; vendas = <b>estoque + mín. 1 jogador</b>. O chefe não produz sozinho.", "⚠️ <b>Zonder medewerkers geen productie/verkoop.</b> NPC-vraag ontstaat; verkoop = <b>stock + min. 1 speler</b>. Baas produceert niet alleen.", "⚠️ <b>Fără angajați nu există producție/vânzări.</b> Cerere NPC generată; vânzări = <b>stoc + min. 1 jucător</b>. Șeful nu produce singur.", "⚠️ <b>Bez zaměstnanců žádná produkce/prodej.</b> NPC poptávka vzniká; prodej = <b>sklad + min. 1 hráč</b>. Šéf sám neprodukuje.", "⚠️ <b>Χωρίς υπαλλήλους όχι παραγωγή/πωλήσεις.</b> Δημιουργείται ζήτηση NPC· πωλήσεις = <b>stock + min. 1 παίκτης</b>.", "⚠️ <b>Без сотрудников нет производства/продаж.</b> Спрос NPC генерируется; продажи = <b>склад + мин. 1 игрок</b>. Босс не производит один.", "⚠️ <b>没有员工无法生产和销售。</b>会生成 NPC 客户需求；销售需要<b>库存 + 至少 1 名玩家员工</b>。老板不能单独生产。", "⚠️ <b>لا إنتاج/مبيعات بدون موظفين.</b> يُنشأ طلب NPC؛ المبيعات = <b>مخزون + موظف لاعب واحد على الأقل</b>."],
