  "meslek.stock.title": ["Malzeme Stoku & Tedariği", "Material Stock & Supply", "Material Stock & Supply", "Materialbestand & Beschaffung", "Stock Matériaux & Approvisionnement", "Stock de Materiales y Suministro", "Scorte Materiali e Approvvigionamento", "Stock de Materiais e Fornecimento", "Estoque de Materiais e Suprimentos", "Materiaalvoorraad & Bevoorrading", "Stoc Materiale & Aprovizionare", "Sklad Materiálu a Zásobování", "Απόθεμα Υλικών & Προμήθεια", "Склад Материалов и Снабжение", "材料库存与采购", "مخزون المواد والتوريد"],
  "meslek.stock.desc": ["Stok olmadan satış yapılamaz. <b>Çalışan olmadan da üretim yapılamaz</b> — önce işe alım aç, başvuruları kabul et. Malzemeleri kasadan satın al; depo dolunca yükseltme gerekir. Birim satış malzeme maliyeti ~{cost} TL.", "No sales without stock. <b>No production without employees either</b> — open hiring first, accept applications. Buy materials from the vault; upgrade warehouse when full. Unit material cost ~{cost} TL.", "No sales without stock. <b>No production without employees either</b> — open hiring first, accept applications. Buy materials from the vault; upgrade warehouse when full. Unit material cost ~{cost} TL.", "Ohne Lager kein Verkauf. <b>Ohne Mitarbeiter keine Produktion</b> — zuerst Einstellung, Bewerbungen annehmen. Material aus Kasse kaufen; Lager erweitern wenn voll. Materialkosten ~{cost} TL.", "Pas de ventes sans stock. <b>Pas de production sans employés</b> — ouvre recrutement, accepte candidatures. Achète matériaux; agrandis entrepôt si plein. Coût matière ~{cost} TL.", "Sin stock no hay ventas. <b>Sin empleados no hay producción</b> — abre contratación, acepta solicitudes. Compra materiales; mejora almacén si lleno. Coste ~{cost} TL.", "Senza stock niente vendite. <b>Senza dipendenti niente produzione</b> — apri assunzioni, accetta candidature. Compra materiali; amplia magazzino se pieno. Costo ~{cost} TL.", "Sem stock sem vendas. <b>Sem funcionários sem produção</b> — abre contratação, aceita candidaturas. Compra materiais; amplia armazém se cheio. Custo ~{cost} TL.", "Sem estoque sem vendas. <b>Sem funcionários sem produção</b> — abra contratação, aceite candidaturas. Compre materiais; amplie armazém se cheio. Custo ~{cost} TL.", "Geen verkoop zonder stock. <b>Geen productie zonder medewerkers</b> — open werving, accepteer sollicitaties. Koop materialen; upgrade magazijn als vol. Kosten ~{cost} TL.", "Fără stoc fără vânzări. <b>Fără angajați fără producție</b> — deschide angajări, acceptă aplicații. Cumpără materiale; extinde depozitul. Cost ~{cost} TL.", "Bez skladu žádný prodej. <b>Bez zaměstnanců žádná produkce</b> — otevři nábor, přijmi přihlášky. Kup materiál; rozšiř sklad. Náklady ~{cost} TL.", "Χωρίς stock όχι πωλήσεις. <b>Χωρίς υπαλλήλους όχι παραγωγή</b> — άνοιξε πρόσληψη, δέξου αιτήσεις. Αγόρασε υλικά· αναβάθμισε αποθήκη. Κόστος ~{cost} TL.", "Без склада нет продаж. <b>Без сотрудников нет производства</b> — открой найм, прими заявки. Покупай материалы; расширяй склад. Стоимость ~{cost} TL.", "没有库存无法销售。<b>没有员工也无法生产</b> — 先开启招聘并录用。从金库购买材料；仓库满时需升级。单位材料成本约 {cost} TL。", "لا مبيعات بدون مخزون. <b>لا إنتاج بدون موظفين</b> — افتح التوظيف واقبل الطلبات. اشترِ المواد؛ وسّع المستودع. تكلفة ~{cost} TL."],
